> sech(x)
  note: sech(...) read as multiplication: sech is not a function
_(sech: real, x: real) = sech*x
  -> real
> csch(x)
  note: csch(...) read as multiplication: csch is not a function
_(csch: real, x: real) = csch*x
  -> real
> coth(x)
  note: coth(...) read as multiplication: coth is not a function
_(coth: real, x: real) = coth*x
  -> real
> arcsinh(x)
  note: arcsinh(...) read as multiplication: arcsinh is not a function
_(arcsinh: real, x: real) = arcsinh*x
  -> real
> arccosh(x)
  note: arccosh(...) read as multiplication: arccosh is not a function
_(arccosh: real, x: real) = arccosh*x
  -> real
> arctanh(x)
  note: arctanh(...) read as multiplication: arctanh is not a function
_(arctanh: real, x: real) = arctanh*x
  -> real
> asinh(x)
_(x: real) = asinh(x)
  -> real
> acosh(x)
_(x: real) = acosh(x)
  -> real
> atanh(x)
_(x: real) = atanh(x)
  -> real
